{"version":1,"content":"<p>本港周四（5日）大致多雲。</p><p>初時有一兩陣微雨，早上最低氣溫約26°C。</p><p>日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約30°C。</p><p>吹和緩偏東風，初時離岸及高地風勢清勁。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T13:45:52.542965+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":76,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T13:03:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:28.082902+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T13:38:24.568039+00:00","content_hash":"274c6c93d3501c9b5954429933fcaf502c5c510ff95d7e13645c5f28f5237a88","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}